s10-6-p12 : Block
s10-6-p12 = prose (cons "Local-first execution keeps required definitions and state locally available, with synchronization as an explicit process. Replication is itself a program whose merge operations, delivery assumptions, and observable consistency conditions are specified by the selected protocol. A network partition changes the interactions available to that program; it does not change the identity of a locally retained definition. Shared computation and data can consequently cross machines and organizations without imposing a single global execution order or one central application database." nil)
